---
source: crates/ostro/tests/cli_p11.rs
expression: "help(&[\"dlq\", \"dismiss\"])"
---
Dismiss an entry (it leaves the default view; `dlq ls --all` still shows it)

Usage: ostro dlq dismiss [OPTIONS] --reason <REASON> <RUN>

Arguments:
  <RUN>  DLQ member (run id)

Options:
      --reason <REASON>    Operator reason (at most 1024 bytes)
      --server <SERVER>    Server URL [env: OSTRO_SERVER=] [default: http://127.0.0.1:7700]
      --json               Print the REST response body as JSON
      --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Per-request timeout (friendly duration; a long-poll adds its wait) [default: 30s]
      --ca-file <PEM>      PEM CA certificate to trust for an https:// server instead of the platform roots (e.g. the cluster CA `<data_dir>/tls/ca.crt` behind a self-signed listener) [env: OSTRO_CA_FILE=]
  -h, --help               Print help
